  <ThingDef ParentName="ApparelNoQualityBase">
    <defName>Muno_StoryCamera</defName>
    <label>生存挑战摄像机</label>
    <description>通过独立挂具穿戴的摄像机，不占用武器栏，镜头始终朝向穿戴者前方。穿戴后定期自动举机拍摄附近殖民者，完整拍摄才积累片段，中断不产出。征召、倒地、睡眠或精神异常时停止拍摄。摄像机仅用于自动拍摄和上传录像带，上传后可获得节目组物资。可在机械加工台制造替代设备。</description>
    <techLevel>Industrial</techLevel>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Apparel/MunoCamera/MunoCamera</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>0.65</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases><MaxHitPoints>180</MaxHitPoints><Mass>1.5</Mass><EquipDelay>2</EquipDelay><WorkToMake>4000</WorkToMake><MarketValue>180</MarketValue></statBases>
    <thingCategories><li>Apparel</li></thingCategories>
    <generateCommonality>0</generateCommonality>
    <costList><Steel>40</Steel><ComponentIndustrial>2</ComponentIndustrial></costList>
    <recipeMaker><recipeUsers><li>TableMachining</li></recipeUsers><researchPrerequisite>Machining</researchPrerequisite><skillRequirements><Crafting>3</Crafting></skillRequirements></recipeMaker>
    <apparel>
      <bodyPartGroups><li>Torso</li></bodyPartGroups>
      <layers><li>Muno_CameraHarness</li></layers>
      <tags><li>MunoStoryCamera</li></tags>
      <renderNodeProperties>
